{"type": "root", "attrs": {"type": "node", "context": "lop", "internal": "karmastandardrendervars", "icon": "LOP/karmastandardrendervars", "since": "18.0", "tags": "rendering,karma", "version": null, "namespace": null}, "body": [{"level": 0, "type": "title", "indent": 0, "text": ["Karma Standard Render Vars"], "extent": [134, 165]}, {"type": "summary", "indent": 0, "text": ["Create standard karma render vars (AOVs/Image Planes)."], "extent": [165, 228]}, {"type": "para", "indent": 0, "text": ["The Karma Standard Render Vars LOP creates standard karma render vars primitives and populates them with predefined expressions for the various image planes. \nTo add additional render vars, for example using custom light path expressions, you can use the ", {"scheme": "Node", "value": "/nodes/lop/additionalrendervars", "type": "link", "text": ["Additional Render Vars LOP"], "fullpath": "/nodes/lop/additionalrendervars.html"}, "."], "extent": [228, 544]}, {"type": "tip_group", "body": [{"type": "tip", "indent": 0, "role": "item", "extent": [544, 549], "body": [{"type": "para", "indent": 4, "text": ["Please also read the ", {"scheme": null, "value": "/solaris/support/aovs", "type": "link", "text": ["Cryptomatte and Material AOVs in Karma"], "fullpath": "/solaris/support/aovs.html"}, " page for more information on specific AOV types."], "extent": [549, 688]}], "container": true}], "container": true, "role": "item_group"}, {"level": 1, "id": "parameters", "container": true, "type": "parameters_section", "indent": 0, "role": "section", "extent": [688, 700], "body": [{"type": "parameters_item_group", "body": [{"type": "parameters_item", "indent": 0, "text": ["Parent Primitive Path"], "extent": [700, 724], "body": [{"type": "para", "indent": 4, "text": ["Here you can define the path where in the Scene Graph Tree your AOVs will appear."], "extent": [749, 836]}], "container": true, "attrs": {"id": "parentprimpath"}, "role": "item"}, {"type": "parameters_item", "indent": 0, "text": ["LPE Tag AOV Limit"], "extent": [836, 855], "body": [{"type": "para", "indent": 4, "text": ["When splitting AOVs per lights' LPE Tag, specify the maximum number of LPE Tag AOVs beyond which the node will emit a warning."], "extent": [877, 1009]}], "container": true, "attrs": {"id": "lpeaovlimit"}, "role": "item"}, {"type": "parameters_item", "indent": 0, "text": ["Omit LPE Tags"], "extent": [1009, 1024], "body": [{"type": "para", "indent": 4, "text": ["When splitting AOVs per lights' LPE Tag, specify a space separated list of lights' LPE Tags which will not create new AOVs."], "extent": [1043, 1172]}], "container": true, "attrs": {"id": "omitlpes"}, "role": "item"}], "container": true, "role": "item_group"}, {"level": 2, "id": null, "container": true, "type": "h", "indent": 0, "text": ["Component Level Outputs"], "extent": [1172, 1202], "body": [{"type": "para", "indent": 0, "text": ["The parameters below are available next to ", {"type": "em", "text": ["each"]}, " render var."], "extent": [1345, 1408]}, {"type": "parameters_item_group", "body": [{"type": "parameters_item", "indent": 0, "text": ["Precision"], "extent": [1408, 1419], "body": [{"type": "para", "indent": 3, "text": ["The color depth of the AOV image. You can choose between ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["16 Bit"]}, " and ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["32 Bit"]}, "."], "extent": [1419, 1507]}], "container": true, "role": "item"}, {"type": "parameters_item", "indent": 0, "text": ["Output Colorspace"], "extent": [1507, 1526], "body": [{"type": "para", "indent": 4, "text": ["You can directly apply a ", {"scheme": null, "value": "/solaris/ocio", "type": "link", "text": ["color space"], "fullpath": "/solaris/ocio.html"}, " to the AOV. Choose one of the available spaces from the parameter\u2019s associated dropdown menu, e.g. ", {"type": "ui", "text": ["ACEScg"]}, "."], "extent": [1526, 1695]}], "container": true, "role": "item"}, {"type": "parameters_item", "indent": 0, "text": ["Split per LPE Tag"], "extent": [1695, 1714], "body": [{"type": "para", "indent": 4, "text": ["Creates additional AOVs for each unique light LPE Tag. To manage LPE Tags for lights, see the ", {"scheme": "Node", "value": "/nodes/lop/lpetag", "type": "link", "text": ["LPE Tag LOP node"], "fullpath": "/nodes/lop/lpetag.html"}, "."], "extent": [1714, 1849]}], "container": true, "role": "item"}], "container": true, "role": "item_group"}, {"type": "note_group", "body": [{"type": "note", "indent": 0, "role": "item", "extent": [1849, 1855], "body": [{"type": "para", "indent": 4, "text": ["You can use ", {"scheme": null, "value": "/solaris/support/filters", "type": "link", "text": ["Solaris filter syntax"], "fullpath": "/solaris/support/filters.html"}, " in the following parameters to filter the sample values. The default ", {"type": "code", "text": ["[\"ubox\", {}]"]}, " simply averages all the sample values within each pixel."], "extent": [1855, 2062]}], "container": true}], "container": true, "role": "item_group"}, {"level": 3, "type": "sep", "indent": 0, "extent": [2062, 2066]}, {"type": "parameters_item_group", "body": [{"type": "parameters_item", "indent": 0, "text": ["Beauty"], "extent": [2066, 2075], "body": [{"type": "para", "indent": 4, "text": ["Add the beauty output as a ", {"type": "code", "text": ["color4f"]}, " render var named ", {"type": "code", "text": ["C"]}, "."], "extent": [2092, 2156]}], "container": true, "attrs": {"id": "beauty"}, "role": "item"}], "container": true, "role": "item_group"}, {"level": 3, "type": "sep", "indent": 0, "extent": [2156, 2160]}, {"type": "parameters_item_group", "body": [{"type": "parameters_item", "indent": 0, "text": ["Beauty Unshadowed"], "extent": [2160, 2180], "body": [{"type": "para", "indent": 4, "text": ["Add the unoccluded (unshadowed) beauty output as a ", {"type": "code", "text": ["color3f"]}, " render var named ", {"type": "code", "text": ["beautyunshadowed"]}, ", using the LPE ", {"type": "code", "text": ["unoccluded;C.*[LO][LO]"]}, "."], "extent": [2207, 2350]}], "container": true, "attrs": {"id": "beautyunshadowed"}, "role": "item"}], "container": true, "role": "item_group"}, {"level": 3, "type": "sep", "indent": 0, "extent": [2350, 2354]}, {"type": "parameters_item_group", "body": [{"type": "parameters_item", "indent": 0, "text": ["Combined Diffuse"], "extent": [2354, 2373], "body": [{"type": "para", "indent": 4, "text": ["Add the combined (any number of bounces) diffuse surface reflection component as a ", {"type": "code", "text": ["color3f"]}, " render var named ", {"type": "code", "text": ["combineddiffuse"]}, ", using the LPE ", {"type": "code", "text": ["C<RD>.*L"]}, "."], "extent": [2399, 2559]}], "container": true, "attrs": {"id": "combineddiffuse"}, "role": "item"}], "container": true, "role": "item_group"}, {"level": 3, "type": "sep", "indent": 0, "extent": [2559, 2563]}, {"type": "parameters_item_group", "body": [{"type": "parameters_item", "indent": 0, "text": ["Direct Diffuse"], "extent": [2563, 2580], "body": [{"type": "para", "indent": 4, "text": ["Add the direct (no bounces) diffuse surface reflection component as a ", {"type": "code", "text": ["color3f"]}, " render var named ", {"type": "code", "text": ["directdiffuse"]}, ", using the LPE ", {"type": "code", "text": ["C<RD>L"]}, "."], "extent": [2604, 2747]}], "container": true, "attrs": {"id": "directdiffuse"}, "role": "item"}], "container": true, "role": "item_group"}, {"level": 3, "type": "sep", "indent": 0, "extent": [2747, 2751]}, {"type": "parameters_item_group", "body": [{"type": "parameters_item", "indent": 0, "text": ["Indirect Diffuse"], "extent": [2751, 2770], "body": [{"type": "para", "indent": 4, "text": ["Add the indirect (one or more bounces) diffuse surface reflection component as a ", {"type": "code", "text": ["color3f"]}, " render var named ", {"type": "code", "text": ["indirectdiffuse"]}, ", using the LPE ", {"type": "code", "text": ["C<RD>.+L"]}, "."], "extent": [2796, 2954]}], "container": true, "attrs": {"id": "indirectd